<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 9.9 points to 735.9 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 9.9 points to 735.9 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 9.9 points on Monday to 735.9 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Nine of the ten sectoral indices rose, with the transport fund index rising the most, up 35.5 points to 1,153.7.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
